cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these materials, please cite the work as below."
title: "The U.S. Retirement System: Fast Facts"
abstract: >-
  Replication materials for an Economic Innovation Group analysis of access,
  participation, and employer contributions in the U.S. retirement savings system,
  using the Survey of Income and Program Participation (2025 release, December 2024
  reference month), together with a CBO-style present-value estimate of the federal
  retirement tax expenditure and a measure of the Saver's Match eligibility-versus-access
  gap.
type: software
authors:
